          "SV9 Deck Build: $31.21 ÷ 171 = $0.18/card; Generations Battle Set: $33.46 ÷ 240 = $0.14/card; Start Deck 100 Battle Collection: $26.77 ÷ 60 = $0.45/card",
          "Cheapest two-deck start: $8.93 + $11.15 = $20.08",
